  "interpretation": [
    "CLawType RTTI identifies the object at 0x1445b8638; its constructor installs the parser vtable at virtual-base offset 0x740.",
    "The ai_will_do atom is 0x29df. The field parser branches to 0x141709d64, selects parser receiver -0x270 (= CLawType +0x4d0/0x4d8 trigger pair), and passes country scope tag 5 to its parser interface.",
    "Candidate iteration resolves a CCountryLaw for the actor and candidate law type. CCountryLaw stores law type at +0x38 and actor country ID at +0x40; its RTTI and constructor are separately frozen.",
    "The candidate qualification call at 0x141548e39 enters 0x1415b9b20. The observed successful prior-check path calls the CLawType trigger wrapper at 0x1415b9cf7 with the candidate type and resolved country.",
    "The trigger wrapper at 0x14170c2a0 evaluates the +0x4d0 member in a tag-5 context containing country +0x18. Candidate type identity is available to the native caller; this does not establish a named script law scope.",
    "A false qualification return branches to 0x1415490d8, advancing the current candidate loop. Downstream scoring and positive-score rejection execute separately and remain vanilla-owned."
